# Agent tooling and local skill installs.
# Ignored because the skill trees are sourced in part from SGTechStack/ai-coding-workflow-d2,
# which answers 404 unauthenticated while this repo answers 200 — committing them would
# disclose a private repo into a public one. Same boundary as App-Standards (see wayfinder
# ticket 06). `.claude/skills/*` are additionally absolute symlinks into `.agents/`, which
# would not resolve on any other machine.
.agents/
.claude/
.kiro/
agent/
skills-lock.json

